// claim: **A recursion that is not a tail call stops at 10 000 active calls**
// 10 000 calls at once are allowed; the next one is a `##Depth` error that
// `!?` catches, and the program goes on (D7, GLB-133).
f(n) {
    ? n == 0 { <~ 0 }
    <~ 1 + f(n - 1)
}
>> f(9999) ¶                                        // → 9999
!? { >> f(10000) ¶ } :! ##Depth { >> "##Depth" ¶ }  // → ##Depth
